## Response format (envelope)

Reply with exactly: one ```json block with metadata, then one ```glsl block with the shader body.

```json
{"scene_id": "{{ scene_id }}", "notes": "...", "math_requests": [], "perf_tier": "light|medium|heavy", "quality_knobs": ["MAX_STEPS", "fbm octaves"]}
```

```glsl
void mainImage(out vec4 fragColor, in vec2 fragCoord) { ... }
```

Do NOT write the header, uniforms, main(), or library functions. Do NOT use `eval`-like tricks. Write original code, no clichés.
